WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.539
(playful music)

00:00:11.143 --> 00:00:12.028
- [Voiceover] So my daughter just told me

00:00:12.028 --> 00:00:14.966
she uses my toothbrush
to brush the dog's teeth.

00:00:14.966 --> 00:00:16.225
How's your day going?

00:00:16.225 --> 00:00:17.705
- [Voiceover] The kids
walked in on me and my wife

00:00:17.705 --> 00:00:19.284
wrestling again.

00:00:19.284 --> 00:00:20.519
My son said, "Mommy should stop

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:22.238
'cause it always sounds
like she's losing."

00:00:22.238 --> 00:00:23.358
- [Voiceover] My
four-year-old just told me,

00:00:23.358 --> 00:00:25.786
"It's okay, I love you,
so I might not put you

00:00:25.786 --> 00:00:27.517
in the washing machine tonight."

00:00:27.517 --> 00:00:30.160
- [Voiceover] My son just said
I have a comforting forehead.

00:00:30.160 --> 00:00:31.523
Weirdest compliment ever.

00:00:31.523 --> 00:00:33.409
- [Voiceover] Turned 26 today.

00:00:33.409 --> 00:00:36.908
My son told me I'm old like
a tree and gonna die soon.

00:00:36.908 --> 00:00:38.900
- [Voiceover] My five-year-old
just asked my three-year-old

00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:41.209
to step into her office.

00:00:41.209 --> 00:00:43.253
She concluded the conversation with,

00:00:43.253 --> 00:00:46.573
"And remember, my door is always open."

00:00:46.573 --> 00:00:48.257
- [Voiceover] I went to see
a mortgage advisor with my

00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:50.329
seven-year-old son, and when we sat down

00:00:50.329 --> 00:00:54.798
across from his desk, my son
said, "I'm not her husband."

00:00:54.798 --> 00:00:56.422
- [Voiceover] My son said, "Mommy,

00:00:56.422 --> 00:00:57.736
you are a terrible cook,

00:00:57.736 --> 00:00:59.243
but I eat your food because I love you,

00:00:59.243 --> 00:01:01.577
and I don't want to hurt your feelings.

00:01:01.577 --> 00:01:04.152
But, I don't want to die either."

00:01:04.152 --> 00:01:06.607
- [Voiceover] My young son
just told me he wants to be a

00:01:06.607 --> 00:01:08.591
hooker when he's older.

00:01:08.591 --> 00:01:10.124
He meant fisherman.

00:01:10.124 --> 00:01:12.682
- [Voiceover] My daughter told
me the moon was a stalker,

00:01:12.682 --> 00:01:14.064
and I asked why.

00:01:14.064 --> 00:01:17.209
She said, "Because it's
always following me."

00:01:17.209 --> 00:01:19.206
- [Voiceover] My son ran out
of my bedroom waving my blue

00:01:19.206 --> 00:01:23.570
vibrator in the air, yelling,
"Look at my new lightsaber!"

00:01:23.570 --> 00:01:28.004
Why do these things happen
when the neighbors are over?

00:01:28.004 --> 00:01:30.523
(playful music)

